    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">To safeguard your bike against any potential damages during transportation, it's advisable to opt for 100% declared-value marine transit insurance. This insurance covers the full declared value of your bike, providing comprehensive coverage against loss or damage that may occur during transit.</p>
